null}}}},{"id":"activity-764","seq":764,"timestamp":"1788617540Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":764,"endedSeq":1576,"startedAt":"1788617540Z","endedAt":"1788618457Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":764,"activityEndSeq":1576,"totalEventCount":103,"toolCallCount":92,"thoughtCount":11,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":6,"writtenFileCount":21,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0aa43bde7d4b02bf016a9c26d41f0c87d0a864ba0f37953518","seq":1700,"timestamp":"1788618457Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","content":"基础认证合同已转绿：Web 由统一 setup 安装 IndexedDB；长期设备键固定为非导出 P-256 ECDSA/SPKI，Java 以 `EC`/`SHA256withECDSA` 验证；Host Ed25519 与 Relay/Noise X25519 均有独立算法标签；错误算法和算法变化均拒绝；固定 Java/Web challenge vector 两端通过。下一步进入 Noise/Relay 传输，先核对依赖 API 和现有 frame 状态机，再用标准 XX 三消息互操作测试驱动接线。","startedSeq":1577,"endedSeq":1700,"startedAt":"1788618457Z","endedAt":"1788618459Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":1282,"revision":1700,"observedAt":"1788618459Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788617177Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788618459Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788617177,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788618459,"revision":1700,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0aa43bde7d4b02bf016a9c26d41f0c87d0a864ba0f37953518","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-1701","seq":1701,"timestamp":"1788618466Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":1701,"endedSeq":1833,"startedAt":"1788618466Z","endedAt":"1788618678Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":1701,"activityEndSeq":1833,"totalEventCount":28,"toolCallCount":22,"thoughtCount":6,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":11,"writtenFileCount":2,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_064aa3670b2a3a6d016a9c27a94cb887d0b4c72d67e3fb7193","seq":1943,"timestamp":"1788618678Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","content":"浏览器 XX 三消息状态机已完成并通过本端互认证、pinning、route AD 和 replay fail-closed 测试。复核时发现现有 Java/浏览器 transport 在自动 rekey 边界还有同源缺陷：发送方先提升 epoch，而接收方在 rekey 前先比较旧 epoch，因此恰在阈值处必然断线。这个回归可由当前 Stage 5 改动直接导致，必须在互操作 vector 前修复；不会新增额外状态模型。","startedSeq":1834,"endedSeq":1943,"startedAt":"1788618678Z","endedAt":"1788618680Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":1503,"revision":1943,"observedAt":"1788618680Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788617177Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788618680Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788617177,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788618680,"revision":1943,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_064aa3670b2a3a6d016a9c27a94cb887d0b4c72d67e3fb7193","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-1945","seq":1945,"timestamp":"1788618680Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":1945,"endedSeq":2155,"startedAt":"1788618680Z","endedAt":"1788618984Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":1945,"activityEndSeq":2155,"totalEventCount":29,"toolCallCount":25,"thoughtCount":4,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":2,"writtenFileCount":9,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0dc766b43e89165e016a9c28deca1087d09090079d7cd3d263","seq":2272,"timestamp":"1788618984Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","content":"Java 固定库的互操作测试正确暴露了浏览器实现仍非标准：Noise 每个 handshake message 在 token 之后还要处理 message payload；当握手 cipher 已有 key 时，即使 payload 为空也产生 16-byte authentication tag，因此标准 XX 长度是 32/96/64，而不是 32/80/48。这是设计边界缺陷，不