230d252c792cd","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-2577","seq":2577,"timestamp":"1788619536Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":2577,"endedSeq":2595,"startedAt":"1788619536Z","endedAt":"1788619562Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":2577,"activityEndSeq":2595,"totalEventCount":5,"toolCallCount":4,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":0,"writtenFileCount":0,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0e90a80ab2d80a6b016a9c2b22f29487d0b7e3d17e077fb0cd","seq":2685,"timestamp":"1788619562Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","content":"中断后的首次编译发现一处模块边界问题：Stage 4 Remote bootstrap 只依赖 HCP protocol，不能反向依赖 Host Core 的算法常量。算法名属于 wire contract，而非 Host 实现细节；我会把它集中到 `ji-host-protocol` 的手写协议常量类，Host 与 Remote 共用该真源，避免新增依赖或散落字符串。","startedSeq":2596,"endedSeq":2685,"startedAt":"1788619562Z","endedAt":"1788619563Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":2117,"revision":2685,"observedAt":"1788619563Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788619517Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788619563Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":2071,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788619517,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788619563,"revision":2685,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0e90a80ab2d80a6b016a9c2b22f29487d0b7e3d17e077fb0cd","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-2686","seq":2686,"timestamp":"1788619563Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":2686,"endedSeq":2954,"startedAt":"1788619563Z","endedAt":"1788619950Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":2686,"activityEndSeq":2954,"totalEventCount":35,"toolCallCount":31,"thoughtCount":4,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":3,"writtenFileCount":8,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_063e3de0d41742fe016a9c2ca17d0487d0b6646052294d50c5","seq":3072,"timestamp":"1788619950Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","content":"当前 HCP ACK/CAS 接线已编译，Web 仍全绿。接下来我会先关闭 Host durable 事实模型的明确偏差：现实现“每个事件都生成 snapshot”且事件没有时间戳，无法满足 500-event/5-minute 与 7-day retention。范围依据是 Stage 5 明确退出合同；省略会让断线 replay、Host restart 和慢 Client 恢复证据无效。修复将只扩展同一 HostStore 原子记录，不引入 Relay 或 UI 第二事实源。","startedSeq":2955,"endedSeq":3072,"startedAt":"1788619950Z","endedAt":"1788619952Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":2506,"revision":3072,"observedAt":"1788619952Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788619517Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788619952Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":2071,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788619517,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788619952,"revision":3072,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_063e3de0d41742fe016a9c2ca17d0487d0b6646052294d50c5","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-3073","seq":3073,"timestamp":"1788619956Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":3073,"endedSeq":3105,"startedAt":"1788619956Z","endedAt":"1788619999Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":3073,"activityEndSeq":3105,"totalEventCount":6,"toolCallCount":5,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":2,"writtenFileCount":0,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_04d00670dda834de016a9c2cb7e9d887d08cb9a631860a99dc","seq":3230,"timestamp":"1788619999Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","content":"在继续 Relay 数据面前还需要收紧一项直接前置合同：Noise XX 的 Client 静态 X25519 key 必须与 P-256 challenge key 分开持久和授权；否则虽然握手标准兼容，Host 仍无法把 Noise peer 映射到已授权设备。该字段只扩展设备身份记录与配对 wire，不改变 SSH direct 语义：SSH desktop 继续显式 Ed25519，且其 Noise 字段必须为空；浏览器设备则必须同时携带 P-256 SPKI 与独立 X25519 raw 公钥。","startedSeq":3106,"endedSeq":3230,"startedAt":"1788619999Z","endedAt":"1788620000Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":2554,"revision":3230,"observedAt":"1788620000Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788619517Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788620000Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":2071,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788619517,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788620000,"revision":3230,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_04d00670dda834de016a9c2cb7e9d887d08cb9a631860a99dc","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-3232","seq":3232,"timestamp":"1788620000Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":3232,"endedSeq":3548,"startedAt":"1788620000Z","endedAt":"1788620384Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":3232,"activityEndSeq":3548,"totalEventCount":38,"toolCallCount":35,"thoughtCount":3,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":0,"writtenFileCount":9,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0437ff3bdb851bb0016a9c2e51c8a087d0a98a14bc5328f6d2","seq":3671,"timestamp":"1788620384Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","content":"刚才的红灯不是 Noise 算法回退，而是 IndexedDB schema 演进与并行测试共享库暴露的迁移缺口：已有 P-256 记录没有新 `noisePrivateKey` 时当前代码直接失败。正确做法是显式把设备身份库升级为 v3，在保留 P-256 deviceId/签名密钥的同时一次性生成独立 X25519 key 并持久化；不会 reinterpret 旧 key bytes，也不会改变算法。随后测试必须清理 v3 库，避免并行 fixture 写入旧 schema。","startedSeq":3549,"endedSeq":3671,"startedAt":"1788620384Z","endedAt":"1788620386Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":2940,"revision":3671,"observedAt":"1788620386Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788619517Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1