7d0a0aefaa6c352ee43","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-5252","seq":5252,"timestamp":"1788622269Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":5252,"endedSeq":5473,"startedAt":"1788622269Z","endedAt":"1788622456Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":5252,"activityEndSeq":5473,"totalEventCount":31,"toolCallCount":27,"thoughtCount":4,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":2,"writtenFileCount":3,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_088a5abc988a8c68016a9c367192ec87d0ad3591152668a549","seq":5531,"timestamp":"1788622457Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","content":"协议 binding 已按 schema 重新生成，并在 HCP durable frame 上携带 RFC 3339 `occurred_at`。现在运行 Host Core 的最小回归，收集剩余旧断言与真实实现失败，避免盲目批量放宽测试。","startedSeq":5474,"endedSeq":5531,"startedAt":"1788622457Z","endedAt":"1788622457Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":5011,"revision":5531,"observedAt":"1788622457Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788619517Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788622457Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":2071,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788619517,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788622457,"revision":5531,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_088a5abc988a8c68016a9c367192ec87d0ad3591152668a549","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-5532","seq":5532,"timestamp":"1788622457Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":5532,"endedSeq":5540,"startedAt":"1788622457Z","endedAt":"1788622471Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":5532,"activityEndSeq":5540,"totalEventCount":2,"toolCallCount":1,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":0,"writtenFileCount":0,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_094253a789f580a3016a9c3682e36087d0a7ec63a022a11f09","seq":5725,"timestamp":"1788622472Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","content":"剩余 6 个失败分两类：\n\n1. 5 个仍是旧的“event payload 必须等于 snapshot / 每事件推进 snapshot”断言。\n2. Abort TCK 揭示了真实的时钟注入缺陷：测试 Session 的 `createdAt` 固定为 2026-09-04，而 Store 用系统时钟判断活跃写入，因而首个 active event 被视为已过 5 分钟并立即生成 snapshot。更重要的是，`PersistentHostStore` 每次恢复都会新建系统时钟 Memory Store，无法确定性验证 5 分钟边界。\n\n修复方向是把 cadence Clock 作为 HostStore 构造依赖传递，生产默认仍为 UTC 系统时钟；测试使用固定/可推进时钟。不会新增第二事实源，只让既有时间策略可验证。","startedSeq":5541,"endedSeq":5725,"startedAt":"1788622472Z","endedAt":"1788622474Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":5028,"revision":5725,"observedAt":"1788622474Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788619517Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788622474Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":2071,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788619517,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788622474,"revision":5725,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_094253a789f580a3016a9c3682e36087d0a7ec63a022a11f09","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-5728","seq":5728,"timestamp":"1788622479Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":5728,"endedSeq":5936,"startedAt":"1788622479Z","endedAt":"1788622662Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":5728,"activityEndSeq":5936,"totalEventCount":30,"toolCallCount":23,"thoughtCount":7,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":3,"writtenFileCount":5,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0537dd91c458c863016a9c372549a087d08ccea6ff4cf97eb1","seq":6025,"timestamp":"1788622663Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","content":"另一个持久语义缺口同时可由代码直接确认：`PersistentHostStore.sameState` 没有比较 per-device acknowledgements，因此 ACK 只在临时 Memory aggregate 内变化，`saveIfChanged` 会把它误判为无修改，重启后 ACK 丢失。这个缺陷直接违反“per-device ACK durable / reconnect recovery”，现在一并修正并添加 SQLite restart 断言。","startedSeq":5937,"endedSeq":6025,"startedAt":"1788622663Z","endedAt":"1788622664Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":5218,"revision":6025,"observedAt":"1788622664Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788619517Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788622664Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":2071,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788619517,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788622664,"revision":6025,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0537dd91c458c863016a9c372549a087d08ccea6ff4cf97eb1","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-6026","seq":6026,"timestamp":"1788622664Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":6026,"endedSeq":6162,"startedAt":"1788622664Z","endedAt":"1788622848Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":6026,"activityEndSeq":6162,"totalEventCount":20,"toolCallCount":14,"thoughtCount":6,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":0,"writtenFileCount":4,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0995311a103085e7016a9c37f5efb087d0af89b2203b62ebbd","seq":6274,"timestamp":"1788622848Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","content":"Host/SQLite store gate 已恢复全绿，并新增了 500-event、5-minute、7-day、event timestamp 与 ACK restart 覆盖。接下来继续当前 Task 4 的另一半：审计 Abort/Permission 的共享 command journal 与 durable CAS 路径。目标不是给 HCP 单独加内存去重，而是让 ACP/HCP 都通过 Host-owned canonical service，确保同 `commandId` 重试幂等、异 payload 冲突、并发首答获胜且重启后仍可判断结果。","startedSeq":6163,"endedSeq":6274,"startedAt":"1788622848Z","endedAt":"1788622850Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":5404,"revision":6274,"observedAt":"1788622850Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788619517Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788622850Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":2071,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788619517,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788622850,"revision":6274,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0995311a103085e7016a9c37f5efb087d0af89b2203b62ebbd","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-6277","seq":6277,"timestamp":"1788622855Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":6277,"endedSeq":6519,"startedAt":"1788622855Z","endedAt":"1788623113Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":6277,"activityEndSeq":6519,"totalEventCount":50,"toolCallCount":40,"thoughtCount":10,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":14,"writtenFileCount":0,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0acbb8f7b849155f016a9c38f2f0dc87d096bf439b102867cd","seq":6704,"timestamp":"1788623113Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","content":"根因边界现已明确：`PermissionBroker` 只能是活跃进程里的等待器，不能成为 Permission 状态真源。正确顺序必须是：\n\n1. HostStore 在单 Session 原子事务中验证 `commandId + payloadHash`、Permission revision，并写 canonical Permission 决议与 command journal；\n2. 若 live Broker 中仍有 waiter，再通知它解除 Tool effect；\n3. Core 收到通知时允许“canonical 已以相同 outcome/revision 提交”的幂等 no-op；\n4. Host 重启后即使 waiter 消失，canonical 决议仍供 Run recovery 使用。\n\nAbort 同理：HostStore 原子提交 command journal + Run `CANCELLING`，然后才请求取消 live effect。这样网络重试不会依赖当前 Run 是否还 active。将按这个边界实现，不把 broker map 持久化。","startedSeq":6520,"endedSeq":6704,"startedAt":"1788623113Z","endedAt":"1788623117Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":5671,"revision":6704,"observedAt":"1788623117Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788619517Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788623117Z","paused":false,